[]{#sec:intro label="sec:intro"}

The goal of this paper is to survey some results on Reidemeister torsions of orientable, hyperbolic three-manifolds of finite volume. Torsions are viewed as invariants of hyperbolic manifolds and also as functions on the variety of $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{C})$-characters.

